{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1335781-totem-questions-advantages-aspiration-influences-etc","id":1335781,"title":"Totem questions: Advantages, Aspiration, Influences, etc","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-14T13:27:01-07:00","id":1335781,"title":"Totem questions: Advantages, Aspiration, Influences, etc","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> As a Storyteller I like to put as much detail as possible in the world-building, including full stats for allies and antagonists, please consider that for the questions here: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>I want to make a Totem for a pack that is being influenced by the Maeljin, so far I have:<br /> <br /> Zia<br /> Aspiration: Satisfy dark urges<br /> Totem Points: 21<br /> Rank: 3<br /> Attributes: Power 7, Finesse 7, Resistance 7<br /> Willpower: 10<br /> Essence: 20<br /> Initiative: 14<br /> Defense: 7<br /> Speed: 19<br /> Size: 5<br /> Corpus: 12<br /> Influences: Lust \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> Manifestations: Twilight Form, Gauntlet Breach, Fetter, Possess<br /> Numina: Aggressive Meme, Drain, Emotional Aura, Host Jump, Implant Mission, Rapture<br /> Ban: If Zia hasn't been in the presence of someone indulging in lust for 8 hours, it becomes morose and lethargic losing it's defense.<br /> Bane: A human voluntarily celibate for a year.<br /> Totem Advantage: Presence +1, Stamina +1, Merit: Striking Looks 2<br /> <br /> Are the aspiration and Influences sufficiently representative for a spirit that wants to transform the pack into a sex cult?</li> <li>What type (<i>Umia </i>and <i>Ilthum</i>) of spirit could offer the Mystery Cult Initiation and/or the Professional Training merits as Totem Advantages?</li> </ol><br /> <br /> Thanks,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 01-29-2020, 04:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T13:56:25-07:00","id":1335787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1335781-totem-questions-advantages-aspiration-influences-etc#post1335781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the aspiration and Influences sufficiently representative for a spirit that wants to transform the pack into a sex cult?</div> </div> </div> </div>You're really spread out in terms of Influences, and Money and Violence don't really scream sex cult. Passion 3, Sex 1 should do the trick (or the other way around, or Sex 3, Vice 1).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What type (<i>Umia </i>and <i>Ilthum</i>) of spirit could offer the Mystery Cult Initiation and/or the Professional Training merits as Totem Advantages? </div> </div> </div>If it's offering the Mystery Cult Initiation, it implies it is the head of or at least a powerful influence on a mystery cult. Or perhaps a spirit of cults.<br /> <br /> Professional Training would imply it's a spirit of certain professions. Like Soldier for a spirit of war (and not just random combat, but aspects of war like the bureaucracy or organization), Doctor for a spirit of not just medicine or the Red, but a spirit tied to a specific hospital, thus with links to people who have been in that hospital or part of its administration).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-14-2019, 04:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T14:48:10-07:00","id":1335796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1335781-totem-questions-advantages-aspiration-influences-etc?p=1335787#post1335787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're really spread out in terms of Influences, and Money and Violence don't really scream sex cult. Passion 3, Sex 1 should do the trick (or the other way around, or Sex 3, Vice 1).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I wanted something <i>magath</i>-like, but it makes more sense to have<i> Influences: Passion 2, Sex 2, Vice 2</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T06:57:44-07:00","id":1335881,"title":"","content":"Each dot of an Influence is generally worth a lot more than having additional Influences. Unless there's a reason to not have any Influences above 2 I'd recommend a third dot in one of them. I would also combine Passion and Sex into a single Lust Influence. That should also give you enough dots to branch out if you want a magath-like Totem.<br /> <br /> For the Bane I'd add a time requirement. A human who's been voluntarily celibate for a certain period of time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T07:25:38-07:00","id":1335886,"title":"","content":"Ok, yes, it would make sense something like <i>Bane: A human voluntarily celibate for a year</i>.<br /> <br /> I am not certain in the influences, originally I was using: Money 1, Passion 2, Sex 1, Violence 1, Youth 1; inspired in the Resonances from <b>Shunned by the Moon</b>. And I wanted to use money to symbolize paid sex, violence for abusive sex and youth for more unsavory practices.<br /> <br /> Would those ideas be covered more with<i> Influences: Lust 3, Vice 3</i>? Or a spread of<i> Lust 3, Vice 1, Money 1, Violence 1</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T11:42:53-07:00","id":1335926,"title":"","content":"Also, that ban doesn't represents any obstacle to the spirit, and this is a rank 3 being. Spirits naturally influence their spheres of, well, influence. If the spirit is meant to be magath, figure out a paradox for it's ban.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12191,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","user":"Malus","date":". 09-15-2019, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T17:51:49-07:00","id":1335968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1335781-totem-questions-advantages-aspiration-influences-etc?p=1335926#post1335926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, that ban doesn't represents any obstacle to the spirit, and this is a rank 3 being. Spirits naturally influence their spheres of, well, influence. If the spirit is meant to be magath, figure out a paradox for it's ban.</div> </div> </div> </div>What would be an suitable Ban for this spirit? (either as a magath or as a regular spirit)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T20:17:12-07:00","id":1335976,"title":"","content":"If it hasn't been in the presence of someone indulging their vice for 8 hours, it becomes morose and lethargic, thus losing it's defense.<br /> <br /> That means it'll have a specific hunting ground at nights, where most of the population isn't out and about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T08:22:32-07:00","id":1336217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1335781-totem-questions-advantages-aspiration-influences-etc?p=1335976#post1335976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it hasn't been in the presence of someone indulging their vice for 8 hours, it becomes morose and lethargic, thus losing it's defense.<br /> <br /> That means it'll have a specific hunting ground at nights, where most of the population isn't out and about.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Love this Ban, but a concerns that a player raised: would be better to lose defense alone, lose defense and halving speed, or halving both speed and defense? (In tune with the sluggish idea and trying to balance a Rank 3 ban)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 09-18-2019, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T20:19:17-07:00","id":1336435,"title":"","content":"I don't see the need: there's few things that can outrun an urhan. Meanwhile spirits don't suffer Primal Fear to their defense from Gauru.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}